Drop-in runtime loader: install a mod folder, then start a build that contains every installed mod

Usage: hmloader runtime [OPTIONS] [DIR] [-- <ARGS>...]

Arguments:
  [DIR]      Folder containing .hmmod files. Defaults to the loader's mods folder
  [ARGS]...  Arguments passed to horizon-client

Options:
      --home <HOME>            Data folder for installed mods and instances [env: HORIZON_HMMOD_HOME=]
      --resources <RESOURCES>  Prepared Horizon resources (the folder holding horizon-resources.json)
      --dry-run                Print the command instead of starting the game
  -h, --help                   Print help
